Please make sure the templates/themes is a symbolic link for
the themes directory in  your Intranet Home application.


Forexample, if you have installed the home application in
%DocumentRoot%/home, the themes directory is:

%DocumentRoot%/home/templates/themes

If you are installing the document publisher in %DocumentRoot%/ld_tool
you can make a link such as:


ln -s %DocumentRoot%/home/templates/themes  %DocumentRoot%/ld_tool/apps/templates/themes


Make sure you replace %DocumentRoot% with appropriate path.
